{"title":"Structure of a RangedSummarizedExperiment","markdown":{"headingText":"Structure of a RangedSummarizedExperiment","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n## The big picture\n\nA `RangedSummarizedExperiment` (RSE) is best imagined as a **rectangular container** where rows are genomic features (genes, transcripts, peaks…) and columns are samples.  Every slot is **row-indexed** or **column-indexed**, so subsetting one slot automatically subsets all others.\n\n::: {.diagram-container}\n\n```{=html}\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 820 480\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n     style=\"max-width:100%;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;\">\n\n  <!-- ── background ── -->\n  <rect width=\"820\" height=\"480\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n\n  <!-- ── ASSAY MATRIX (centre) ── -->\n  <rect x=\"220\" y=\"80\" width=\"340\" height=\"260\" rx=\"8\"\n        fill=\"#dbeafe\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e40af\">assay(s)</text>\n  <!-- column headers -->\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">S1</text>\n  <text x=\"355\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">S2</text>\n  <text x=\"422\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">S3</text>\n  <text x=\"489\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#374151\">S4</text>\n  <!-- grid lines -->\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"143\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"143\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"176\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"209\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"209\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"242\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"275\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"275\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"308\" x2=\"560\" y2=\"308\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"321\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"321\" y2=\"340\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"389\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"389\" y2=\"340\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"456\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"456\" y2=\"340\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <!-- sample values -->\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"131\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">1243</text>\n  <text x=\"355\" y=\"131\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">876</text>\n  <text x=\"422\" y=\"131\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">2104</text>\n  <text x=\"489\" y=\"131\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">543</text>\n  <text x=\"270\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">88</text>\n  <text x=\"355\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">91</text>\n  <text x=\"422\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">77</text>\n  <text x=\"489\" y=\"164\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#1e40af\">102</text>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#6b7280\" text-anchor=\"middle\">… genes × samples …</text>\n  <!-- row label -->\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"368\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#374151\">\n    n samples (columns)\n  </text>\n  <text x=\"200\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#374151\"\n        transform=\"rotate(-90,200,215)\">m features (rows)</text>\n\n  <!-- ── rowRanges (left) ── -->\n  <rect x=\"20\" y=\"80\" width=\"180\" height=\"260\" rx=\"8\"\n        fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"110\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">rowRanges</text>\n  <text x=\"110\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#374151\">GRanges / GRangesList</text>\n  <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <!-- rows -->\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"131\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#166534\">chr1:100-200 [+]</text>\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#166534\">chr1:500-650 [+]</text>\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"193\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#166534\">chr2:100-300 [-]</text>\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#166534\">chr3:200-400 [+]</text>\n  <text x=\"110\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6b7280\">…</text>\n  <!-- connecting arrow -->\n  <line x1=\"200\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"218\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#16a34a\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-green)\"/>\n\n  <!-- ── colData (top) ── -->\n  <rect x=\"220\" y=\"370\" width=\"340\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\"\n        fill=\"#fef9c3\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"392\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#a16207\">colData</text>\n  <text x=\"390\" y=\"410\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#374151\">DataFrame  (samples as rows)</text>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"430\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#78350f\">Sample  Condition  Batch  Sex</text>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"447\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#78350f\">S1      treated    B1     M</text>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"462\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#78350f\">S2      control    B1     F …</text>\n  <!-- connecting arrow -->\n  <line x1=\"390\" y1=\"342\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"368\" stroke=\"#ca8a04\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-yellow)\"/>\n\n  <!-- ── rowData (right, inside RSE) ── -->\n  <rect x=\"580\" y=\"80\" width=\"220\" height=\"260\" rx=\"8\"\n        fill=\"#fce7f3\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"690\" y=\"68\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#9d174d\">rowData</text>\n  <text x=\"690\" y=\"102\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#374151\">DataFrame  (features as rows)</text>\n  <line x1=\"580\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"800\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#f9a8d4\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#831843\">gene_id   symbol  biotype</text>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#831843\">ENSG0001  BRCA1   protein_coding</text>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#831843\">ENSG0002  TP53    protein_coding</text>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#831843\">ENSG0003  MIR21   miRNA</text>\n  <text x=\"690\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\" fill=\"#6b7280\">…</text>\n  <!-- connecting arrow -->\n  <line x1=\"562\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"578\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#db2777\"\n        stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-pink)\"/>\n\n  <!-- ── metadata (bottom-right) ── -->\n  <rect x=\"580\" y=\"370\" width=\"220\" height=\"90\" rx=\"8\"\n        fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"690\" y=\"392\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#5b21b6\">metadata</text>\n  <text x=\"690\" y=\"412\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#374151\">named list — anything</text>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"432\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c1d95\">$organism: \"Homo sapiens\"</text>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"450\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c1d95\">$date: \"2025-01-15\"</text>\n  <text x=\"590\" y=\"468\" font-size=\"9\" fill=\"#4c1d95\">$pipeline: \"STAR + featureCounts\"</text>\n\n  <!-- ── outer RSE border ── -->\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"804\" height=\"464\" rx=\"14\"\n        fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 4\"/>\n  <text x=\"416\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"15\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#334155\">RangedSummarizedExperiment</text>\n\n  <!-- ── arrow markers ── -->\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arr-green\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\"\n            refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/>\n    </marker>\n    <marker id=\"arr-yellow\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\"\n            refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z\" fill=\"#ca8a04\"/>\n    </marker>\n    <marker id=\"arr-pink\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\"\n            refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z\" fill=\"#db2777\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n</svg>\n```\n\n**Figure 1.1** — Anatomy of a `RangedSummarizedExperiment`.  \nThe assay matrix is the centre; all other slots are indexed to its rows or columns.\n:::\n\n## The five core slots\n\n<table class=\"slot-table\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n  <th style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Slot</th>\n  <th style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Accessor</th>\n  <th style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Class</th>\n  <th style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Indexed by</th>\n  <th style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Holds</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"background:#dbeafe22;\">\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1e40af;\"><code>assays</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>assay()</code> / <code>assays()</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>SimpleList</code> of matrices</td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">rows & cols</td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Count matrices, normalized values, log-CPM…</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-weight:bold;color:#15803d;\"><code>rowRanges</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>rowRanges()</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>GRanges</code> / <code>GRangesList</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">rows</td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Genomic coordinates of each feature</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#dcfce722;\">\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-weight:bold;color:#9d174d;\"><code>rowData</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>rowData()</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>DataFrame</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">rows</td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Gene symbol, biotype, GC content…</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-weight:bold;color:#a16207;\"><code>colData</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>colData()</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>DataFrame</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">cols</td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Sample ID, condition, batch, QC metrics…</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background:#ede9fe22;\">\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;font-weight:bold;color:#5b21b6;\"><code>metadata</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>metadata()</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\"><code>list</code></td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">—</td>\n  <td style=\"padding:8px 12px;\">Experiment-level free text, parameters…</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n::: {.callout-note}\n## rowData vs rowRanges — what's the difference?\n\nIn a `RangedSummarizedExperiment`, **`rowRanges()`** always returns a `GRanges` object containing the genomic coordinates.  \n**`rowData()`** returns the `mcols()` (metadata columns) of that same `GRanges` — i.e., the non-coordinate per-feature annotations.  \n\nIn a plain `SummarizedExperiment` (no ranges), `rowRanges()` returns `NULL` and `rowData()` returns the full per-feature `DataFrame`.\n:::\n\n## SE vs RSE — the inheritance chain\n\n::: {.diagram-container}\n\n```{=html}\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 220\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n     style=\"max-width:100%;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;\">\n  <rect width=\"600\" height=\"220\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f8f9fa\"/>\n\n  <!-- RectangularData -->\n  <rect x=\"200\" y=\"10\" width=\"200\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\"\n        fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#475569\">RectangularData</text>\n\n  <!-- SummarizedExperiment -->\n  <rect x=\"180\" y=\"80\" width=\"240\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"\n        fill=\"#bfdbfe\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"98\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e40af\">SummarizedExperiment</text>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\"\n        fill=\"#3b82f6\">assays · rowData · colData · metadata</text>\n\n  <!-- RangedSummarizedExperiment -->\n  <rect x=\"160\" y=\"155\" width=\"280\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\"\n        fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"173\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#15803d\">RangedSummarizedExperiment</text>\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\"\n        fill=\"#16a34a\">+ rowRanges (GRanges/GRangesList)</text>\n\n  <!-- arrows -->\n  <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"78\" stroke=\"#64748b\"\n        stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-grey)\"/>\n  <line x1=\"300\" y1=\"124\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"153\" stroke=\"#64748b\"\n        stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-grey)\"/>\n\n  <defs>\n    <marker id=\"arr-grey\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\"\n            refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n      <path d=\"M0,0 L0,6 L8,3 z\" fill=\"#64748b\"/>\n    </marker>\n  </defs>\n</svg>\n```\n\n**Figure 1.2** — Class inheritance. RSE *extends* SE by adding genomic coordinates.\n:::\n\n## Dimensions and names\n\nAn RSE always has two dimensions accessible via `dim()`:\n\n```r\ndim(rse)\n# [1] 20000   8      # 20 000 genes × 8 samples\n\nnrow(rse)   # number of features\nncol(rse)   # number of samples\n\nrownames(rse)  # feature identifiers (e.g. Ensembl IDs)\ncolnames(rse)  # sample names\n```\n\n::: {.callout-important}\n## The golden rule of RSE — subsetting is synchronised\n\n```r\nrse_sub <- rse[1:100, rse$condition == \"treated\"]\n```\n\nThis simultaneously subsets:\n\n- the assay matrix(es) to rows 1–100 and treated columns\n- `rowRanges` to features 1–100\n- `colData` to treated samples only\n- `rowData` accordingly\n\n**You can never accidentally misalign rows and columns.**\n:::\n\n## What does `show()` print?\n\nWhen you type an RSE object name in the console, R calls `show()` and you see something like:\n\n```\nclass: RangedSummarizedExperiment \ndim: 20000 8 \nmetadata(1): ''\nassays(2): counts normcounts\nrownames(20000): ENSG00000000003 ENSG00000000005 ...\nrowData names(3): gene_id symbol biotype\ncolnames(8): S1 S2 S3 S4 S5 S6 S7 S8\ncolData names(4): Sample condition batch sex\n```\n\nEach line directly corresponds to one slot in the diagram above.\n\n## The GRanges slot in depth\n\n`rowRanges(rse)` returns a `GRanges` object with **one range per feature**:\n\n::: {.diagram-container}\n\n```{=html}\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 230\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n     style=\"max-width:100%;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;\">\n  <rect width=\"760\" height=\"230\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f0fdf4\"/>\n\n  <!-- header row -->\n  <rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"740\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\"\n        fill=\"#15803d\"/>\n  <text x=\"100\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"white\">seqnames</text>\n  <text x=\"215\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"white\">ranges</text>\n  <text x=\"350\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"white\">strand</text>\n  <text x=\"470\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"white\">gene_id (mcol)</text>\n  <text x=\"630\" y=\"31\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\"\n        font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"white\">symbol (mcol)</text>\n\n  <!-- grid lines -->\n  <line x1=\"10\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"750\" y2=\"42\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"160\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"420\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <line x1=\"540\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"540\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#86efac\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n\n  <!-- data rows -->\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">chr1</text>\n  <text x=\"170\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">100 000 – 120 000</text>\n  <text x=\"350\" y=\"64\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">+</text>\n  <text x=\"430\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">ENSG00000000003</text>\n  <text x=\"550\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">TSPAN6</text>\n\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">chr1</text>\n  <text x=\"170\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">135 000 – 138 000</text>\n  <text x=\"350\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">-</text>\n  <text x=\"430\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">ENSG00000000005</text>\n  <text x=\"550\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">TNMD</text>\n\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">chr1</text>\n  <text x=\"170\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">200 000 – 215 000</text>\n  <text x=\"350\" y=\"120\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">+</text>\n  <text x=\"430\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">ENSG00000000419</text>\n  <text x=\"550\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">DPM1</text>\n\n  <text x=\"30\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">chr2</text>\n  <text x=\"170\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">45 000 – 59 000</text>\n  <text x=\"350\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">-</text>\n  <text x=\"430\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">ENSG00000000457</text>\n  <text x=\"550\" y=\"148\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#166534\">SCYL3</text>\n\n  <text x=\"300\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"11\"\n        fill=\"#6b7280\">… 20 000 rows total …</text>\n\n  <!-- mcols label -->\n  <rect x=\"424\" y=\"196\" width=\"320\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\"\n        fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#86efac\"/>\n  <text x=\"584\" y=\"212\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"10\"\n        fill=\"#14532d\">← these columns live in mcols(rowRanges(rse))</text>\n</svg>\n```\n\n**Figure 1.3** — Structure of the `GRanges` object stored in `rowRanges()`.  \nThe `seqnames`, `ranges`, and `strand` columns are the **core range fields**;  \nall additional columns (gene_id, symbol…) are **metadata columns** (`mcols`).\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"center","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":false,"code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":true,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":